Version Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot:\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion: 0.20.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003cbr\u003e\nAlso broken on iOS mobile app\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot default (all bots). Not a Cursor IDE model issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConversation ID: c4791723-9dd0-4235-ae70-4ad4a3f16199\u003cbr\u003e\nSupport tickets: T-F81493, T-F81606, T-F81712\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried already: quit/relaunch, Recover, Update, Reset Agent Computer, clear local data, network switch, sign out/in.\u003cbr\u003e\nBroken on both Mac desktop and mobile for every bot.\u003cbr\u003e\nUsage shows 0%. Please rebuild the Agent Computer and keep bots/files/routines.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T18:42:02.048Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":11.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171747,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-mac-mobile-computer-stuck-connecting-messages-get-no-reply-ticket-t-f81493","display_username":"yuan fang","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137884,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-mac-mobile-computer-stuck-connecting-messages-get-no-reply-ticket-t-f81493/171747/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":492069,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T18:41:29.740Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Good news: your Agent Computer is fine, you don’t need to recreate it. The Reset and Update you ran completed successfully, and your bots, chats, files, and routines are still there. So please don’t press Reset or Recover again. Reset can erase data.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s actually happening: it looks like the Grok Bot usage allowance from your trial has been used up. After that, every message gets rejected on our side. At that point the app should show a clear notification, but right now it doesn’t. That’s why the bots just look like they’re staying silent. We’re tracking this issue. This is also why usage shows 0%. It’s a separate enabled pool, not the remaining trial balance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo keep using bots:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/bot/onboarding\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSign in\u003c/a\u003e with the same account you use in the app, and pick a plan, or connect a suitable SuperGrok subscription.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot from the menu bar icon, then reopen it and log in again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReplies should start working within a few minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbout the Connecting status on the panel: it means the connection to Agent Computer is too slow and the health check can’t finish in time. This usually happens when using a VPN or proxy. It doesn’t affect bot replies, but if you can try without VPN, the panel should settle down.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes after you pick a plan and restart.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T18:41:29.740Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171747,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-mac-mobile-computer-stuck-connecting-messages-get-no-reply-ticket-t-f81493","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com/bot/onboarding","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Sign in","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":nu